{
  "about": "What each engine offers, as a fact the conformance scenarios check: conformance/engine/features/engines.feature reads this file and each engine's nuka --help and nuka <command> --help. A command is null for an engine that does not have it, and lists the flags its --help names otherwise. --help and --version are left out, and a negatable flag is named by its negation (--no-check). The site and the README render this file; edit it, not them.",
